## Decision Cheat Sheet

```
Problem: "Find similar items fast"
    │
    ├── < 100M vectors AND already on Postgres  → pgvector
    ├── < 100M vectors AND already on ES        → ES kNN
    ├── < 100M vectors AND need low-latency     → Redis Vector
    ├── > 100M vectors AND want managed         → Pinecone
    ├── > 100M vectors AND complex filtering    → Qdrant
    ├── > 1B vectors AND ok with ops complexity → Milvus
    └── Prototyping RAG                         → Chroma

Recall too low?  → ↑ efSearch (no rebuild) → ↑ M (rebuild)
Latency too high? → ↓ efSearch
Filter is strict? → pre-filter + brute force
Filter is loose?  → post-filter
Writes constant?  → hot/cold pattern
```

